{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ludicrum is a physics sandbox game: a game with no rules, no limits, where you can mess around in a bunch of pre - made physics maps to cause utter chaos!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to crash a tank into a tree and a crowd of people? Go ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to build a giant flying bathtub using the size ray and thrusters? Sure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to detonate a nuke in a remote winter village? Can't stop you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you've ever had an itch to play a game where you can play god and just do whatever, quite literally with no rules, then go ahead and play Ludicrum! It's ludicrous!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104910/extras/041f96ecf276ce144c163e939453c50c.avif?t=1774435803\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104910/extras/233d0561204023dab92560197c6ffaa1.avif?t=1774435803\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104910/extras/b750c4dde72d9608cbeae1bad8008e77.avif?t=1774435803\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4104910?t=1774435803","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104910/f7405aae0226e980ddae805be5f929857b6e391a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774435803","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104910/d40b49587421cdf30c4638f1565402c6f8deedd0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774435803","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store